keywords: [parallel computing, benchmark, OpenMP, MPI, Pthreads, merge sort, matrix multiplication, scaling, reproducibility]
abstract: >-
  C implementations of merge sort and dense matrix multiplication in four execution models, with a validating benchmark
  harness that rejects failed, hung or incorrect runs, separates whole-process from in-program compute time, flags
  oversubscribed configurations, and records the hardware and software environment for each result.
